## 需求
docs/impl-spec/workspace-console/target-lang-setting.md 网页，在“保存”按钮左边，加一个 “重新初始化”。功能是更新 $workspace/memory/languages/$lang/vault/spec 。 用户点击后，需要提示用户： 
```
"知识库规范" 下的文件，可能被替换，若你有修改过 "知识库规范"，文件可能丢失。
```

## 实现设计

1. docs/impl-spec/vault-mcp/vault-mcp-spec.md 增加一个 reset_vault 的工具。基实现逻辑与 create_vault 工具类似，区别是 reset_vault 可以覆盖 $workspace/memory/languages/$lang/vault/spec 中已有的文件:

      Reinitialize an existed target-learning-language vault directory at
      $workspace/memory/languages/$lang/vault/ and seed it with spec/*.md
      (copied from templates/default/spec/*.md with includes expanded via
      everlingo.utils.md_prompt_compiler.compile_prompt + PackageSource,
      matching the same approach as mem_writer_agent.py:67 but without
      shift_headings — each spec file is a standalone top-level document).
      Idempotent: if a spec file already
      exists under spec/, it **can be overwritten**; re-registration is a no-op
      (open_lang is itself idempotent under AppState._lock).
      Workspace-level tool: does **require** session.configure.



